{"id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-jump-operator.md","title":"原书的正归纳 Kripke 算子","display":"df-jump-operator — 原书的正归纳 Kripke 算子","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-jump-operator","aliases":["91-df-jump-operator","91-df-Kripke-jump"],"display":"df-jump-operator — 原书的正归纳 Kripke 算子","depends_on":["[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","[[91-df-ground-model]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-jump-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-jump-operator</span><span>91-df-Kripke-jump</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-jump-operator — 原书的正归纳 Kripke 算子"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"253f996295270684\" href=\"?note=253f996295270684\" title=\"91-df-ground-model\">91-df-ground-model</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_T\">\\(C_T\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 句子编码集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq C_T\">\\(X\\subseteq C_T\\)</span>；编码操作见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a>。</li>\n<li>以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\)</span> 为句子或使量化结果成为句子的公式；闭项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\">\\(s,t\\)</span> 在标准结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N\">\\(\\mathcal N\\)</span> 中求值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)\">\\(J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(X)\">\\(J(X)\\)</span> 恰由下列十三种代码组成：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\begin{aligned}\nJ(X)= {}&amp;\\{\\ulcorner s=t\\urcorner:s^{\\mathcal N}=t^{\\mathcal N}\\}\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\neg(s=t)\\urcorner:s^{\\mathcal N}\\ne t^{\\mathcal N}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\neg\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner:\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\land\\psi\\urcorner:\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X\\land\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner\\in X\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\neg(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\urcorner:\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X\\lor\\ulcorner\\neg\\psi\\urcorner\\in X\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\urcorner:\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X\\lor\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner\\in X\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\neg(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\urcorner:\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X\\land\\ulcorner\\neg\\psi\\urcorner\\in X\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\forall x\\theta\\urcorner:\\forall t\\in\\operatorname{CTerm}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\ \\ulcorner\\theta[t/x]\\urcorner\\in X\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\neg\\forall x\\theta\\urcorner:\\exists t\\in\\operatorname{CTerm}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\ \\ulcorner\\neg\\theta[t/x]\\urcorner\\in X\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\exists x\\theta\\urcorner:\\exists t\\in\\operatorname{CTerm}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\ \\ulcorner\\theta[t/x]\\urcorner\\in X\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\neg\\exists x\\theta\\urcorner:\\forall t\\in\\operatorname{CTerm}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\ \\ulcorner\\neg\\theta[t/x]\\urcorner\\in X\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner T(t)\\urcorner:t^{\\mathcal N}\\in X\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\neg T(t)\\urcorner:t^{\\mathcal N}\\notin C_T\\lor\\operatorname{neg}(t^{\\mathcal N})\\in X\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\begin{aligned}\nJ(X)= {}&amp;\\{\\ulcorner s=t\\urcorner:s^{\\mathcal N}=t^{\\mathcal N}\\}\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\neg(s=t)\\urcorner:s^{\\mathcal N}\\ne t^{\\mathcal N}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\neg\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner:\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\land\\psi\\urcorner:\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X\\land\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner\\in X\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\neg(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\urcorner:\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X\\lor\\ulcorner\\neg\\psi\\urcorner\\in X\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\urcorner:\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X\\lor\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner\\in X\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\neg(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\urcorner:\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X\\land\\ulcorner\\neg\\psi\\urcorner\\in X\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\forall x\\theta\\urcorner:\\forall t\\in\\operatorname{CTerm}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\ \\ulcorner\\theta[t/x]\\urcorner\\in X\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\neg\\forall x\\theta\\urcorner:\\exists t\\in\\operatorname{CTerm}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\ \\ulcorner\\neg\\theta[t/x]\\urcorner\\in X\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\exists x\\theta\\urcorner:\\exists t\\in\\operatorname{CTerm}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\ \\ulcorner\\theta[t/x]\\urcorner\\in X\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\neg\\exists x\\theta\\urcorner:\\forall t\\in\\operatorname{CTerm}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\ \\ulcorner\\neg\\theta[t/x]\\urcorner\\in X\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner T(t)\\urcorner:t^{\\mathcal N}\\in X\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\neg T(t)\\urcorner:t^{\\mathcal N}\\notin C_T\\lor\\operatorname{neg}(t^{\\mathcal N})\\in X\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\\coloneqq X\\subseteq C_T\\land\n\\forall a\\in C_T\\,(a\\in X\\to\\operatorname{neg}(a)\\notin X),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\coloneqq\\{X\\subseteq C_T:J(X)=X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\\coloneqq X\\subseteq C_T\\land\n\\forall a\\in C_T\\,(a\\in X\\to\\operatorname{neg}(a)\\notin X),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\coloneqq\\{X\\subseteq C_T:J(X)=X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本目录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 明确对齐原书的单步正算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>，不再把只定义于一致信息的三值函数当作完整幂集上的算子。\n对整个公式进行递归三值求值得到的跳跃和该单步算子有相同固定点，但中间迭代阶段并非同一个东西；例如本算子第一步只加入合适的原子及否定原子，不会加入全部算术真句。\n存在性由分离公理；所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的出现都是正向成员条件，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 单调。该全集允许过剩；从空集出发的迭代则保持一致性。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 15.5、Lemmata 15.6–15.8、Definitions 15.9–15.11、Lemmata 15.12–15.14，印刷页 189–196，PDF 页 200–207。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-ground-model","status":"resolved","id":"253f996295270684","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C_T$ 是 $\\mathcal L_T$ 句子编码集，$X\\subseteq C_T$；编码操作见 [[91-df-coded-syntax]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"