ed}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\\coloneqq X\\subseteq C_T\\land\n\\forall a\\in C_T\\,(a\\in X\\to\\operatorname{neg}(a)\\notin X),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\coloneqq\\{X\\subseteq C_T:J(X)=X\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false}],"bytes":3095,"backlinks":[{"id":"1791b62b90bdbbfd","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f276735320c6ad44","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d154fdd64209bf0e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$C_T$、$J$、$\\operatorname{ConInfo}$ 使用 [[91-df-jump-operator]] 的签名；$\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)=\\{X\\subseteq C_T:J(X)=X,\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\\}$。"},{"id":"adf7b5cbd73dbafa","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2bc4d1a14a37aabf","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$J$ 为 [[91-df-jump-operator]] 的幂集单调算子。"},{"id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)$ 为 [[91-df-jump-operator]] 的正算子。"},{"id":"3a19d5715745463a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2bc1263010e83604","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\subseteq C_T$ 且 $\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)$，见 [[91-df-jump-operator]]。"},{"id":"fa7a47e0464f94a4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9360972f9b2f8524","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2afb05d81a538d8a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)$ 为 [[91-df-jump-operator]] 中的十三子句正生成算子；$X,Y\\subseteq C_T$。"},{"id":"8adbccc4211045f3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depe